<title>CANADA: Quebec to present budget on March 25.</title>
<headline>Quebec to present budget on March 25.</headline>
<dateline>QUEBEC CITY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quebec Finance Minister Bernard Landry said on Wednesday that he would present the 1997-98 provincial budget next Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The budget will be unveiled in the National Assembly on Tuesday, March 25 at 1600 (EDT),&quot; Landry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The separatist Parti Quebecois government has said it was on target to meet its deficit forecast of C$3.2 billion for fiscal 1996-97 ending March 31.</p>
